ount123\": \"35.99\", \"blendedGrossMarginRateOnListPrice\": \"99.10%\"}], \"summary\": \"潜力菜 1 道，占本期分析菜品 25.00%\", \"categoryCode\": \"POTENTIAL\", \"categoryName\": \"潜力菜\", \"recommendedAction\": \"增加曝光，放到推荐位，可尝试套餐搭配\"}, {\"count\": 1, \"ratio\": \"25.00%\", \"dishes\": [{\"dishId\": \"5\", \"reason\": \"销量和利润贡献都低于本期大多数菜，建议先观察是否需要调整做法、价格或推荐位置。\", \"dishName\": \"核桃芽菜西芹\", \"salesCount\": \"64.00\", \"salesAmount\": \"1600.00\", \"evidenceRefId\": \"ev-dish-portfolio_eliminate-8\", \"actualProfitAmount\": \"1600.00\", \"actualCostTotalAmount123\": \"0.00\", \"blendedGrossMarginRateOnListPrice\": \"100.00%\"}], \"summary\": \"观察菜 1 道，占本期分析菜品 25.00%\", \"categoryCode\": \"ELIMINATE\", \"categoryName\": \"观察菜\", \"recommendedAction\": \"销量和利润贡献暂时都不突出，建议先观察是否需要调整做法、价格或推荐位置。\"}], \"totalDishCount\": 4}, \"cardType\": \"MENU_PORTFOLIO_QUADRANT_CARD\", \"subtitle\": \"系统会把本期参与销售的菜品放在一起比较，根据销量和利润贡献分成四类。\", \"chartType\": \"PIE\"}]', '{\"timeText\": \"2026-05-26～2026-06-02\", \"scopeText\": \"本门店\", \"storeText\": \"汀兰餐厅\", \"contextBar\": \"汀兰餐厅 · 05/26–06/02 · 本门店\", \"dateRangeText\": \"05/26–06/02\", \"permissionScopeText\": \"本门店\"}', '2026-06-02 02:42:02', '2026-06-02 02:42:02', 3);
