AYS\", \"salesBaselineStopDate\": \"2026-04-30\", \"inventoryQueryTimeKind\": \"HYBRID_SNAPSHOT_WITH_PERIOD_BASELINE\", \"salesBaselineStartDate\": \"2026-04-24\", \"bottleneckIngredientName\": \"鲜三黄鸡\", \"dishIngredientCoverNoRecipeGap\": false}, \"cardType\": \"DISH_INGREDIENT_COVER_DAYS_CARD\", \"subtitle\": \"当前库存（截至当前）\", \"sourceAnswerPlanType\": \"DISH_INGREDIENT_COVER_DAYS\"}]', '{\"timeText\": \"2026-04-01～2026-04-30\", \"scopeText\": \"本门店\", \"storeText\": \"汀兰餐厅\", \"contextBar\": \"汀兰餐厅 · 04/01–04/30 · 本门店\", \"dateRangeText\": \"04/01–04/30\", \"permissionScopeText\": \"本门店\"}', '2026-06-02 14:04:03', '2026-06-02 14:04:03', 3);
