对偏低，建议优先复核。\", \"matchMode\": \"LOW_MARGIN_FALLBACK\", \"totalRiskDishCount\": 3}, \"cardType\": \"MENU_HIGH_SALES_LOW_MARGIN_CARD\", \"subtitle\": \"按本轮菜单内销量与毛利率分位识别畅销低利或毛利率相对偏低的菜品\", \"chartType\": \"TABLE\"}]', '{\"timeText\": \"2026-05-27～2026-06-02\", \"scopeText\": \"本门店\", \"storeText\": \"汀兰餐厅\", \"contextBar\": \"汀兰餐厅 · 05/27–06/02 · 本门店\", \"dateRangeText\": \"05/27–06/02\", \"permissionScopeText\": \"本门店\"}', '2026-06-02 18:45:08', '2026-06-02 18:45:08', 3);
