 \"2.4\", \"recipeUnitPerDish\": \"0.2\", \"dailyExpectedUsageQty\": \"1.9143\"}], \"periodFlowLabel\": \"最近7天（5月28日至6月3日）\", \"salesBaselineDays\": 7, \"salesBaselineLabel\": \"最近7天（5月28日至6月3日）\", \"stockSnapshotLabel\": \"当前库存（截至当前）\", \"bottleneckCoverDays\": \"0.84\", \"ingredientRowFields\": [\"ingredientName\", \"recipeUnitPerDish\", \"currentStockQty\", \"currentStockQtyEmptyReason\", \"dailyExpectedUsageQty\", \"dailyExpectedUsageQtyEmptyReason\", \"coverDays\", \"coverDaysEmptyReason\", \"isBottleneck\"], \"salesBaselineSource\": \"DEFAULT_LAST_7_DAYS\", \"salesBaselineStopDate\": \"2026-06-03\", \"inventoryQueryTimeKind\": \"HYBRID_SNAPSHOT_WITH_PERIOD_BASELINE\", \"salesBaselineStartDate\": \"2026-05-28\", \"bottleneckIngredientName\": \"去皮核桃仁\", \"dishIngredientCoverNoRecipeGap\": false}, \"cardType\": \"DISH_INGREDIENT_COVER_DAYS_CARD\", \"subtitle\": \"当前库存（截至当前）\", \"sourceAnswerPlanType\": \"DISH_INGREDIENT_COVER_DAYS\"}]', '{\"timeText\": \"当前库存 · 最近7天（5月28日至6月3日）\", \"scopeText\": \"本门店\", \"storeText\": \"汀兰餐厅\", \"contextBar\": \"汀兰餐厅 · 当前库存 · 最近7天（5月28日至6月3日） · 本门店\", \"permissionScopeText\": \"本门店\"}', '2026-06-03 03:15:03', '2026-06-03 03:15:03', 3);
