Label\": \"当前库存（截至当前）\", \"bottleneckCoverDays\": \"3.11\", \"ingredientRowFields\": [\"ingredientName\", \"recipeUnitPerDish\", \"currentStockQty\", \"currentStockQtyEmptyReason\", \"dailyExpectedUsageQty\", \"dailyExpectedUsageQtyEmptyReason\", \"coverDays\", \"coverDaysEmptyReason\", \"isBottleneck\"], \"salesBaselineSource\": \"DEFAULT_LAST_7_DAYS\", \"salesBaselineStopDate\": \"2026-06-08\", \"inventoryQueryTimeKind\": \"HYBRID_SNAPSHOT_WITH_PERIOD_BASELINE\", \"salesBaselineStartDate\": \"2026-06-02\", \"bottleneckIngredientName\": \"内酯豆腐\", \"dishIngredientCoverNoRecipeGap\": false}, \"cardType\": \"DISH_INGREDIENT_COVER_DAYS_CARD\", \"subtitle\": \"当前库存（截至当前）\", \"sourceAnswerPlanType\": \"DISH_INGREDIENT_COVER_DAYS\"}]', '{\"timeText\": \"当前库存 · 销量基线：最近7天（2026-06-02～2026-06-08）\", \"scopeText\": \"本门店\", \"storeText\": \"月月红\", \"contextBar\": \"月月红 · 当前库存 · 销量基线：最近7天（2026-06-02～2026-06-08） · 本门店\", \"permissionScopeText\": \"本门店\"}', '2026-06-08 23:37:02', '2026-06-08 23:37:02', 13);
